//! Command-line parsing and model loading.
//!
//! The parser implemented here intentionally mirrors the behaviour of
//! the original Clap-2 based interface, including its help text, the
//! order in which validation errors are reported, and several of its
//! error message formats.  Model files are selected by their file name
//! extension: `.obj` models (with optional MTL material libraries) and
//! both ASCII and binary `.stl` models are supported.
//!
//! The input argument is a single value which may name several files
//! separated by spaces, in which case all of them are loaded into a
//! single combined scene.  If several input values are supplied as
//! separate arguments, only the first one is used, mirroring the
//! original's use of Clap's single-value accessor.

use crate::geometry::{LoadedFile, Material, ObjFace, Vec3};
use std::error::Error;
use std::fmt;
